        "DescriptionsMultilanguage": [
          {
              "en": "All zombies have -60% armor durability but gain +200% health and +30% attack damage.",
              "zh": "所有僵尸的防具耐久度-60%，但是生命值+200%，攻击力+30%"
          },
          {
              "en": "All normal zombies gain +120% health. All Imps gain +50% movement speed and +50% attack damage.",
              "zh": "所有普通僵尸的生命值+120%，所有小鬼的移动速度和攻击力+50%"
          },
          {
              "en": "All Ankylo push more zombies and have increased loitering time; some Ankylos spawn at different positions.",
              "zh": "所有甲龙推击僵尸数量提升，徘徊时间提升；部分甲龙出现的位置不同"
          },
          {
              "en": "Other dinosaurs' attributes and special abilities receive minor enhancements.",
              "zh": "其他恐龙的属性和特殊能力少量强化"
          },
          {
              "en": "Some waves, dynamic spawning, and dinosaur positions are modified; mold appears on the field, and some plants are weakened.",
              "zh": "部分波次，动态出怪和恐龙位置有所不同，场上出现霉菌，削弱部分植物"
          }
